abstract: >-
  V15 provides faithful cross-calculus mappings among Governed Transport,
  Execution Custody, and Continuity Admission, preserving exact judgment
  indices, local countermodels, and receipt-bound entitlement. It includes an
  exact-receipt anti-minting result and a held-out partial StaticRole instance
  closed at R3. The exact classification is ATLAS: the work does not establish
  a shared bridge algebra, generic frontier composition, generic ownership,
  generic context transport, or a universal calculus. Inquiry and Preparation
  remain frozen independent comparison-only neighbors outside the PJ primary
  surface. No runtime conformance, JCP implementation, operational AG/NQ
  realization, cryptographic unforgeability, phenomenology, consciousness,
  successful-prediction, or personal-identity claim is made. This metadata is
  prepared for the exact operator-ratified v15 release candidate. The concept
  DOI identifies the software series; no v15 version DOI or publication is
  claimed before a separate operator-controlled release and Zenodo deposit.
